# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the repo and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a contributor with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF working-tree
# files while Prettier writes LF, so every `npm run format` leaves the whole
# tree flagged as modified even though the content is identical. Pinning it
# here makes the policy a property of the repo rather than of each machine's
# global git config.
* text=auto eol=lf
